    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Document the principal's conversation", "items": [
      "Meeting notes, actions taken and an outcome are collected in the follow-up form.",
      "Resigning requires an uploaded resignation letter. Save initializes meeting_logged and records upload time.",
      "Resignation Pending is optional; Ready for HR is a flag on the LOI, not a remote HR integration."
